        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Word of Mouth, \"Walks Like Rihanna\"\n- People: The Wanted\n- Topics: single releases\n\nFacts:\n- The Wanted released six singles before their third studio album Word of Mouth: \"Chasing the Sun,\" \"I Found You,\" \"Walks Like Rihanna,\" \"We Own the Night,\" \"Show Me Love (America),\" and \"Glow in the Dark.\"\n- \"Walks Like Rihanna\" is a song by the British-Irish boy band The Wanted.\n- \"Walks Like Rihanna\" was released in Australia on 10 May 2013.\n- \"Walks Like Rihanna\" was released in the United Kingdom and Ireland on 23 June 2013 as the third single from The Wanted's 2013 album Word of Mouth.\n- \"Glow in the Dark\" was released two weeks before The Wanted's album Word of Mouth.",
